{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8f73a23af68a4019da6af06b9dc1c5234c35ba6de173de893ac40fe5cdc394bf", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの準備は着々と進んでいる）", "zh": "（39PROJECT的准备进行得十分顺利。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4fe3fe3572197449d8188e4a10d89a2bfaf0119ad7546adbef9cf964f39bec84", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ、新人アイドル達のための\nオリエンテーションを開く予定だ）", "zh": "（今天就是预计\n为新人偶像们举办说明会的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1002_se", "source_sha256": "66bfa653b65f581afb4a2076b00d1dda2c89ad952f391357a3231f2787167360", "ja": "ダダダダッ……バンッ！", "zh": "哒哒哒哒……碰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "f0110a40537a7b836fc2c8e0eb5e5169c64498e6e43641d39046e4c5db5e8fd8", "ja": "{$P$}！！　た、大変です！", "zh": "{$P$}！！不、不好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4642273ab17690827da82afe7200f202b7d5597dc448b018ac5d1999bb24847b", "ja": "うわっ！？　な、なんだ真か。\nびっくりした……。", "zh": "哇！？原、原来是真啊。\n吓了我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "c1113348f67d54356f6906f888a6ce6913a5b3e9aba370f7a0b50a2ecd122f1e", "ja": "ああっ、驚かしちゃってすみません……\nって、そうじゃなくて！", "zh": "啊啊，不好意思吓到你了……\n啊，不是这个啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "fd388c1f95a0f21115271553d7365bc879e376ef1bcc38c556d853a25c6fc61e", "ja": "大変なんです！　劇場の廊下やエントランスに、\n女の子がいっぱいいるんですよ！", "zh": "不好了！剧场的走廊和大厅，\n挤满了好多女孩子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a495447c4d866cbc3681807157c70581c99c4b45b40b1e9f0344f233142e87f3", "ja": "そういうことか。\nあの子達は、39プロジェクトに合格した子達だよ。", "zh": "原来你要讲的是这个。\n她们是39PROJECT所录取的人啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "904cdf85eeac76f5134c4741643c1e14ef5d9fcd1d2b6a10a883a3ab7a67fbeb", "ja": "39プロジェクト……ああ、なるほどっ。\n{$P$}が集めてきた子達ですね？", "zh": "39PROJECT……啊～原来如此！\n是{$P$}找来的女孩子们吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "21cadbdc10140bb44ee7888a5f050f3c470004723de7310a1a46fe2aab647ceb", "ja": "どうりでカワイイ子ばっかりだと思いました！\nみんな、きゅぴるんって感じで輝いてて……。", "zh": "难怪一个个看上去都这么可爱！\n她们每个人都给在下一种闪亮亮的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "520e3fd4e23458e54e6b7b6ebccdbdf0ebdd6ff63060e0fb49a249274f74bd01", "ja": "もう、すっごく眩しかったですっ。\nへへっ、さすが{$P$}ですね～！", "zh": "闪亮到在下都快睁不开眼睛了。\n嘿嘿，真不愧是{$P$}～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8a7ee3ff28a975cfccb9320679a5d269639aa4e78ee2f09ded201056ab209404", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\nまだまだ、これからが本番だけどな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢夸奖。\n好戏接下来才要上场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "a64241f5fc22db384106e73791a81afb8fb06238f7f0acac6b0514168d6f4304", "ja": "でも、そっか。これからボク達、あの子達と一緒に\nアイドルをしていくんですね……。", "zh": "不过，对耶。从今以后，我们就要\n和那些女孩子一起当偶像了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "889489c083375553aae23f88705de98c3f13b1dbfbf8e6465bd718448117b337", "ja": "これでますます、ボクのきゅぴるんパワーが\n増幅されそうです！", "zh": "感觉在下的闪亮亮之力\n会变得越来越强呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "657ada6f7146c2f1a4fcdccc7f1c57e52857961040f087218cda170f5648486c", "ja": "真がそんなに喜んでるのを知ったら、\nきっと新人の子達もうれしいだろうな。", "zh": "要是知道真这么高兴，\n那些新人一定也会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d2c50d02fdfb2391bb66bb78b6412cbb9b6b498dc31244d4d2670063423b3747", "ja": "アイドルの先輩として、\n彼女達のことよろしく頼むぞ！", "zh": "你身为偶像这一行的前辈，\n要好好照顾她们喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "b9464ea32420567b3ef203e6f4b3352952512ef2ec688c251eaf6e59aaa6c2fb", "ja": "もちろんですよっ！　任せてください！", "zh": "这是当然的！放心交给在下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "82df0539c77376cad3813604e6694efb41aa3edf8c97bbde1105af3d748e8384", "ja": "なんだったら、みんなのオリエンテーション、ボクが\n引き受けましょうか？　それ、資料ですよね？", "zh": "不如，干脆就让在下来主持她们的说明会吧？\n那些是等会要用的资料对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "d0e2ec1730fa693fac5de2e82d99718063fad11e2d1d43b5c556bd6235e4a79f", "ja": "今日はボク、時間がありますし、\nこの機会にみんなと仲良くなりたいな～って！", "zh": "反正在下今天也有空档，\n想趁这个机会跟大家打好关系呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_1019", "source_sha256": "21013f4115116d6cab175a86d4c2d1695f32d4437c9f7ddb001b8c2e83cde8c7", "ja": "お願いしようかな", "zh": "那就麻烦啰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5805b3c72cdb54cf29eb0d417deeb2c78d3bf7b9485371be07f7fa7f1e262102", "ja": "なるほど。それじゃ、お願いしようかな。", "zh": "原来如此，那就麻烦你啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_2001_006mak", "source_sha256": "184912643c810aa86061b8bb07872a0621efa18dac55349acc71297f8c82825e", "ja": "やーりぃ！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}！", "zh": "太棒啦！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_2002_006mak", "source_sha256": "c62ef4426fb8ddc08c90d0f5b508ca2fe3f604bf8320ff9137f2323bcfa92b42", "ja": "そうだ。せっかくだから衣装に着替えようかな……。\nこないだのメイド服、まだあります？", "zh": "对了，难得有这个机会，在下就换套服装吧……\n之前的女仆装还在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "f83e09c9868925ee170ecf1046573c36044bc393ec4b729121d3e91c341064d0", "ja": "あれは貸衣装だからもうないぞ。……というか、\n今日は最初だし、いつも通りでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "那是租来的，已经还回去了。\n……是说今天第一次碰面，穿得跟平时一样就好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_2004_006mak", "source_sha256": "82dd49f75b4a466c7389335cf9073335c1c775923ff86d69db1a9a81f0988761", "ja": "う～ん、それもそうですね。\nよく考えたら、メイド服を着る意味が分からないし…。", "zh": "唔～这么说好像也有点道理。\n仔细一想，在下也不晓得换上女仆装的意义在哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_2005_006mak", "source_sha256": "02731ca1cef06ec37111fff25c034504f443fd028f8c487cbd46ea6d753ea63d", "ja": "わかりました！　それじゃあいつも通り、\nボクらしくやってきます！", "zh": "收到！那就按照在下\n以往的作风去做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "bd4c29b4e5b6f45b4f6566cffde09618a95891a55721897b41496afa15f18589", "ja": "（常に前向きで、なりたい自分に向かって、\n真っ直ぐに頑張る真）", "zh": "（真总是这么积极，\n朝着自己想成为的目标笔直前进。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "9084ba82b76683e0547720352163b9998feb6f7c6413ed17d8a4edc400d67f59", "ja": "（そんな真なら、\nきっと後輩達の最高の手本になるだろう）", "zh": "（这样的真，\n肯定会是新人们最棒的楷模。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
